WEBVTT

00:00:52.799 --> 00:00:55.240
This is Tang Hongtu.

00:00:55.439 --> 00:00:56.439
Second Master Tang.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.000
Tang.(Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org)

00:00:58.079 --> 00:00:59.200
Second Master Tang.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.119
The head of the number one Tang family in Bian Shui.

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:03.359
It's me.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:05.879
To be able to work for Second Master...

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.359
is my honor.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:11.840
May I ask what you want me to do?

00:01:17.799 --> 00:01:19.760
I want you to go back to Old Street.

00:01:19.799 --> 00:01:22.840
Get everyone to sign the demolition contract...

00:01:22.879 --> 00:01:24.319
with our Tang Group.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:26.480
Second Master...

00:01:27.159 --> 00:01:29.799
That kid Zhao Fengsheng saved...

00:01:29.799 --> 00:01:30.879
has already woken up.

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.719
If I go back now...

00:01:32.799 --> 00:01:34.239
the neighbors will probably investigate me...

00:01:34.239 --> 00:01:35.280
What are you afraid of?

00:01:35.879 --> 00:01:37.280
Those two idiots who did the kidnapping...

00:01:37.359 --> 00:01:39.200
Master Mu has already taken care of them for you.

00:01:40.079 --> 00:01:41.760
As long as you deny it to the end...

00:01:42.319 --> 00:01:44.079
who dares to call you a trafficker?

00:01:45.719 --> 00:01:46.519
Chen Xiaobei.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.439
Do you think I called you here...

00:01:48.519 --> 00:01:49.920
to discuss this with you?

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.359
If you don't handle this well...

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:53.359
you...

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:55.480
will go down to join your two brothers.

00:01:58.480 --> 00:01:59.200
Master Mu...

00:01:59.200 --> 00:01:59.840
Second Master...

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:00.680
Have mercy!

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:01.799
Darn it.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:02.719
I'll do it.

00:02:13.039 --> 00:02:14.000
Xiaobei.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:14.919
These past few days...

00:02:14.919 --> 00:02:16.319
you've really worked hard.

00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:17.039
It's nothing.

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:19.039
Our houses are really old, right?

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.199
They'll need renovating sooner or later.

00:02:20.199 --> 00:02:20.719
Coincidentally...

00:02:20.719 --> 00:02:22.000
I know this big boss.

00:02:22.039 --> 00:02:22.639
No problem, no problem.

00:02:22.639 --> 00:02:23.319
Chen Xiaobei!

00:02:23.879 --> 00:02:25.599
This trafficker dares to come back?

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:27.360
Let's teach him a lesson!

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.000
I've also looked at the contract.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.319
I just wanted to help the neighbors...

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:34.039
renovate their houses.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.080
Build new buildings, live in new homes.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:35.680
Chen Xiaobei!

00:02:36.639 --> 00:02:37.439
Come here!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:39.560
Let go!

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:40.159
What are you doing?

00:02:40.159 --> 00:02:41.360
What's going on?

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.599
What have you learned from Zhao Fengsheng?

00:02:44.599 --> 00:02:46.280
Be polite to the neighbors.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.319
Uncle Snake...

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:48.800
This jerk framed Fengsheng.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.159
Today he must explain himself to everyone.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.360
It really was a misunderstanding.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:55.960
Didn't we already explain it clearly?

00:02:57.319 --> 00:02:59.319
You think saying "misunderstanding" settles it?

00:02:59.319 --> 00:03:01.560
How do we account for the neighbors wronging Fengsheng?

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:06.360
I apologize.

00:03:07.199 --> 00:03:09.439
I'll accept any punishment you give.

00:03:09.759 --> 00:03:10.639
You said it.

00:03:11.439 --> 00:03:12.319
Don't play dumb.

00:03:13.719 --> 00:03:15.000
You've been hanging out with the Traffickers' Village

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.120
people for a long time.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.360
Xiaoxiao was kidnapped by you.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:20.039
Brother Fengsheng.

00:03:20.039 --> 00:03:21.319
This is a huge misunderstanding.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.400
That day, I saw Xiaoxiao being kidnapped.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.319
In a moment of panic,

00:03:24.319 --> 00:03:25.879
I thought you were with them.

00:03:26.719 --> 00:03:27.520
Brother.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.199
I

00:03:28.199 --> 00:03:29.400
have already heard.

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:32.039
You and Gangzi took care of the Traffickers' Village guys

00:03:32.039 --> 00:03:33.159
and even stormed the Ghost Face Hall.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.919
You're heroes of our Old Street.

00:03:34.919 --> 00:03:35.599
Right?

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:36.439
Yeah.

00:03:36.439 --> 00:03:37.240
Don't call me brother.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:38.319
You're not worthy.

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:40.719
You want to put on an act for me?

00:03:40.919 --> 00:03:41.719
Brother Fengsheng.

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:43.400
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:03:43.919 --> 00:03:45.000
About the misunderstanding,

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:45.919
it was my fault.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.120
I apologize to you.

00:03:50.159 --> 00:03:51.360
I'll kowtow to you.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:54.560
Fengsheng.

00:03:54.759 --> 00:03:56.400
Forgive others when you can.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.120
Xiaobei.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:58.159
Back then, wasn't he

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:00.039
also worried about Xiaoxiao?

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.759
Auntie Wang, don't you get it?

00:04:02.039 --> 00:04:03.439
He's a trafficker.

00:04:03.879 --> 00:04:04.919
Don't talk nonsense.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:06.159
Fengsheng.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.159
The misunderstanding about you being a trafficker,

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:09.639
the whole Old Street knows.

00:04:09.919 --> 00:04:11.599
Besides, you didn't lose anything.

00:04:11.719 --> 00:04:13.479
Let's just drop this matter.

00:04:13.479 --> 00:04:14.800
I didn't lose anything?

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:16.319
We're all neighbors here.

00:04:16.439 --> 00:04:17.920
Why make such an ugly scene?

00:04:18.279 --> 00:04:19.360
I'm not trying to make a scene.

00:04:20.199 --> 00:04:21.360
Think about it yourselves.

00:04:21.839 --> 00:04:23.319
Every time he's about to be exposed,

00:04:23.519 --> 00:04:24.879
he disappears and hides.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.959
He wasn't here when the Ghost Face Hall surrounded Old Street.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.839
He wasn't here when Xiaoxiao woke up.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.240
Isn't that clear enough?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.000
Brother Fengsheng.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:32.879
A colossal misunderstanding.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:33.839
These past few days,

00:04:33.839 --> 00:04:34.920
I've been helping the neighbors

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.839
find opportunities to get rich.

00:04:36.839 --> 00:04:38.120
Opportunities to get rich?

00:04:38.639 --> 00:04:40.199
The neighbors have all joined the Chinese Association.

00:04:40.199 --> 00:04:41.480
What else do we need you to arrange?

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.720
Selling goods earns just a pittance.

00:04:44.399 --> 00:04:45.519
Look at Auntie Wang's hands.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:46.680
Even with calluses this thick,

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:47.879
can she earn enough for an apartment?

00:04:47.879 --> 00:04:51.000
Young Bei is also thinking of the neighbors.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:53.439
He contacted a big boss from outside

00:04:53.839 --> 00:04:56.959
to redevelop our Old Street.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.399
What?

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:00.879
Redevelop?

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:02.519
What big boss?

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:05.360
Explain yourself clearly.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.879
Second Master Tang from the Tang Group.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:09.319
He said

00:05:09.319 --> 00:05:11.199
our Old Street has huge development potential.

00:05:11.519 --> 00:05:13.040
He plans to acquire Old Street

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.199
and turn it into high-end apartments.

00:05:14.199 --> 00:05:16.079
Tang Hongtu wants to demolish Old Street.

00:05:16.839 --> 00:05:18.160
He calls it redevelopment.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.759
And on a separate plot nearby,

00:05:20.879 --> 00:05:22.680
he'll build new houses for the neighbors.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.319
Plus a large sum of demolition compensation.

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:26.120
And compensation money.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:27.399
That's good news!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.839
The neighbors will have a better life.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:31.680
Such a good deal...

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.519
what's in it for the Tang Group?

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:34.879
Boss Tang

00:05:34.879 --> 00:05:37.079
naturally wants to develop Bian Shui better.

00:05:37.079 --> 00:05:37.800
He says

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:39.600
as Bian Shui's leading enterprise,

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.199
this is how to attract foreign investment

00:05:41.199 --> 00:05:42.160
and grow bigger.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:44.720
Does Uncle Snake and the neighbors know?

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:46.279
Of course, it's been explained clearly.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:47.399
Xiaobei.

00:05:47.399 --> 00:05:48.120
Come on, let's go.

00:05:48.279 --> 00:05:50.519
Tell Auntie the details again.

00:05:50.759 --> 00:05:51.560
Right, right.

00:05:51.639 --> 00:05:52.439
Let's go.

00:05:54.639 --> 00:05:55.439
Fengsheng.

00:05:55.759 --> 00:05:57.360
Why did you pull me back?

00:05:57.959 --> 00:05:59.040
I still think

00:05:59.399 --> 00:06:00.800
this guy Chen Xiaobei

00:06:00.959 --> 00:06:01.920
is a bit suspicious.

00:06:04.759 --> 00:06:06.639
Who cares if Chen Xiaobei is suspicious?

00:06:06.759 --> 00:06:07.920
Demolition isn't a bad thing.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:09.560
Think about our Old Street houses.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:10.759
How many years old are they?

00:06:10.879 --> 00:06:12.160
We still have to use public toilets.

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.160
What a hassle.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:14.480
I know that, of course.

00:06:15.079 --> 00:06:16.839
Our Old Street has no real business,

00:06:16.959 --> 00:06:18.199
no profitable industry.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.480
Tang Hongtu spending big money to buy Old Street...

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:24.000
I still can't figure it out.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.839
Why overthink it?

00:06:26.319 --> 00:06:28.000
As long as the Tang Group pays up,

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.160
we won't lose out.

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:29.879
Right?

00:06:29.879 --> 00:06:31.199
Once we have the money,

00:06:31.279 --> 00:06:31.920
Er Ni's mother

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.759
won't stand in the way of your marriage.

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:35.000
We're talking serious business.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.319
Why bring up Er Ni?

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.279
Understood, understood.

00:06:38.839 --> 00:06:40.360
I'll have the guys go ask around

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.480
to see what's really going on.

00:06:44.279 --> 00:06:45.319
Is Brother Fengsheng home?

00:06:45.319 --> 00:06:45.920
You jerk!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:46.839
You dare show your face?

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:47.720
What's wrong?

00:06:47.959 --> 00:06:50.120
Here to kowtow, apologize, and admit your mistake?

00:06:51.279 --> 00:06:52.079
Brother Fengsheng.

00:06:52.199 --> 00:06:53.639
It was all a misunderstanding before.

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:56.000
Today, Second Master himself sent word.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:58.240
He'd like to invite you to the Tang Group for a chat.

00:06:58.240 --> 00:06:59.800
Tang Hongtu is inviting me?

00:07:00.079 --> 00:07:00.879
Yes.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:01.959
Second Master said

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:04.319
you, Zhao Fengsheng, are a man of courage.

00:07:04.319 --> 00:07:06.319
You wouldn't even dare to meet him.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:08.920
A provocation.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:09.560
Fengsheng.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.439
Don't fall for it.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:13.480
Tang Hongtu is a man who holds sway over Bian Shui.

00:07:13.519 --> 00:07:15.079
He has no need to play dirty tricks with me.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.519
And I happen to want to meet him.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.079
Let's go. Lead the way.

00:07:24.399 --> 00:07:25.240
Brother Gangzi

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:27.519
Second Master only invited one person.

00:07:28.079 --> 00:07:29.120
So,

00:07:32.199 --> 00:07:32.759
let's go.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.560
Director Wang, you better win big today.

00:07:51.959 --> 00:07:52.920
Playing, huh?

00:07:56.199 --> 00:07:57.439
You've gotten prettier again.

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.920
The Tang Group even has a casino in Bian Shui.

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:03.040
Master Mu.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:03.800
Master Mu.

00:08:03.879 --> 00:08:05.040
Please lend me another five hundred thousand.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.079
I'm sure I can win it all back.

00:08:06.079 --> 00:08:06.480
Master Mu.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:07.279
Lend you more?

00:08:08.199 --> 00:08:09.399
Your house,

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:10.319
your car,

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.600
and your beautiful wife

00:08:12.639 --> 00:08:13.800
are already mortgaged.

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.079
What do you have left to borrow against?

00:08:16.759 --> 00:08:17.560
Master Mu.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:18.079
You...

00:08:18.079 --> 00:08:19.319
Look, how much am I worth?

00:08:19.399 --> 00:08:20.839
I'll mortgage myself, Master Mu.

00:08:21.959 --> 00:08:23.680
A life is the cheapest thing there is.

00:08:26.279 --> 00:08:27.000
You two,

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.240
take him to the coal mine to dig.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:30.160
A hundred a day.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.960
Until his debt is paid.

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.159
A hundred bucks a day?

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.799
When will I ever get out?

00:08:35.799 --> 00:08:36.600
Master Mu!

00:08:46.279 --> 00:08:47.559
Zhao Fengsheng.

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:51.759
You dare show your face in front of me?

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:56.399
Master Mu.

00:08:56.759 --> 00:08:58.639
Your new look is so cool.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:01.759
How can you be so darn annoying?

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:04.519
You know what?

00:09:04.759 --> 00:09:06.480
I'll settle the score for this eye

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.360
right now.

00:09:07.559 --> 00:09:08.360
Master Mu.

00:09:08.759 --> 00:09:11.000
Second Master wants to see Zhao Fengsheng.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:12.559
I know.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:15.320
Otherwise,

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:18.320
you wouldn't be standing here talking nonsense.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.039
Weren't you a dog for the Ghost Face Hall?

00:09:21.759 --> 00:09:23.440
Now you're a dog for the Tang family?

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.240
Are you addicted to being a dog?

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:26.159
You!

00:09:26.159 --> 00:09:28.120
Didn't Uncle Gui Lang teach you how to talk to me?

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:31.919
Uncle Gui Lang?

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:33.960
He's already dead.

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:37.240
Your backer is gone.

00:09:37.679 --> 00:09:39.679
And you're still acting so tough with me?

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:40.879
You did it?

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.159
He was getting senile.

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:47.320
So I had no choice

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.399
but to show some filial piety

00:09:48.879 --> 00:09:50.960
and put him out of his misery.

00:09:51.639 --> 00:09:52.559
After all,

00:09:52.879 --> 00:09:54.960
Uncle Gui Lang and I were acquainted.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:57.360
I'm considering

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:59.639
whether to gouge out your other eye

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:00.720
to see him off properly.

00:10:04.159 --> 00:10:05.639
Zhao Fengsheng.

00:10:07.799 --> 00:10:09.360
Don't look at me like that.

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:12.480
If Second Master didn't want to see you,

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.200
I'd finish you off right now.

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:20.600
Can't be bothered with your nonsense.

00:10:21.679 --> 00:10:22.840
Come with me to see Second Master.

00:10:37.799 --> 00:10:38.960
Killing the Ghost Wolf leader,

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:40.279
taking in Mu Jinfu,

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:41.799
demolishing Old Street...

00:10:42.879 --> 00:10:44.279
This series of moves

00:10:44.279 --> 00:10:46.320
seems to be all Tang Hongtu's doing.

00:10:46.519 --> 00:10:48.159
What does this Second Master Tang want?

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.480
I've long heard of Old Street's Zhao Fengsheng.

00:11:02.919 --> 00:11:03.840
Brother Shengzi.

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:06.759
I've been wanting to meet you for a long time.

00:11:10.039 --> 00:11:11.559
This sofa of yours is comfortable.

00:11:12.159 --> 00:11:13.200
Must have cost a lot, right?

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.840
A sofa is nothing.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:15.879
As long as you, Brother Shengzi,

00:11:15.879 --> 00:11:17.759
are willing to join my Tang Group,

00:11:17.919 --> 00:11:21.159
villas, luxury cars, beautiful women—you'll have it all.

00:11:21.639 --> 00:11:23.279
So you're recruiting me, Second Master?

00:11:23.279 --> 00:11:24.000
That's right.

00:11:24.159 --> 00:11:26.559
You, Zhao Fengsheng, with just two or three men,

00:11:26.559 --> 00:11:28.759
managed to take down Traffickers' Village

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.440
and even bravely stormed the Ghost Face Hall.

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.799
It's truly impressive.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:35.600
I admire you.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.120
You flatter me, Second Master.

00:11:37.519 --> 00:11:39.080
After you took over the Ghost Face Hall,

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.720
you're the biggest local power in Bian Shui.

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.480
There's no need to recruit me.

00:11:44.039 --> 00:11:46.720
You probably don't want me leading the neighbors to cause trouble

00:11:46.879 --> 00:11:48.679
and delay your demolition project, right?

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.080
Brother Shengzi gets straight to the point.

00:11:54.879 --> 00:11:56.559
I do have that intention.

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:58.240
Second Master.

00:11:59.039 --> 00:12:01.000
You say our Old Street is just a piece of worthless land.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:02.600
No industry to speak of.

00:12:02.879 --> 00:12:04.720
Why are you so fixated on it?

00:12:05.039 --> 00:12:06.360
Expanding industrial investment,

00:12:06.519 --> 00:12:08.320
increasing our presence in Bian Shui,

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:09.879
attracting foreign capital...

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:11.200
This is

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.799
our strategic goal

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:14.200
as the Tang Group.

00:12:16.039 --> 00:12:16.840
I don't understand.

00:12:19.039 --> 00:12:21.000
Brother Shengzi isn't well-versed in business.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.200
That's understandable.

00:12:22.639 --> 00:12:24.559
But you just need to remember one thing:

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:27.480
Having our Tang Group develop Old Street

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:30.799
is nothing but beneficial for all of you.

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:35.759
And what if I disagree?